# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing here reaches the browser. Never add a VITE_ variable that holds an
# address, a key or a bearer: Vite writes every VITE_ value into the public
# script, and the build fails if that script mentions one (see vite.config.ts).
# No database key belongs in this project at all; storage is Control Center's.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Server-side only, read by api/enquiry.js (a Vercel function). Set both in the
# Vercel project's environment variables for Production once Control Center's
# receiving route exists. While either is unset the endpoint validates requests
# and forwards nothing.
#
# The Control Center route that receives one validated enquiry row.
ENQUIRY_FORWARD_URL=https://example.invalid/enquiries
# A bearer that allows only that one write. Never commit a real value.
ENQUIRY_FORWARD_BEARER=replace-me
